{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Lab Simulator</strong> is a creature collector that lets you create, raise, train, and battle your own monsters. Every experiment is a surprise, every recipe a chance for discovery.<br><br><br>Buy mysterious essences to hatch unique Fulus from fragile eggs. Every experiment is a chance to create something new.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/f421ea54e54f696ae5f8bbf214c4e22c.poster.avif?t=1758039285\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/f421ea54e54f696ae5f8bbf214c4e22c.webm?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/f421ea54e54f696ae5f8bbf214c4e22c.mp4?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden recipes by combining different essences. Unlock surprise creatures and expand your growing collection.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/687f0250ca6c6eaa7e3dea9e9c521f1a.poster.avif?t=1758039285\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/687f0250ca6c6eaa7e3dea9e9c521f1a.webm?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/687f0250ca6c6eaa7e3dea9e9c521f1a.mp4?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter turn-based battles in the station. Compete in tournaments for big rewards or test your team in free matches.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/cb8e07d1db1ecf9390d8ae7e29b5ea4d.poster.avif?t=1758039285\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/cb8e07d1db1ecf9390d8ae7e29b5ea4d.webm?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/cb8e07d1db1ecf9390d8ae7e29b5ea4d.mp4?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orb your creatures to keep them forever in your permanent collection. Store their stats and create powerful combinations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ff6219a74fd2a043f231441ab2e2820f.poster.avif?t=1758039285\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ff6219a74fd2a043f231441ab2e2820f.webm?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ff6219a74fd2a043f231441ab2e2820f.mp4?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your stored orbs for profit and invest in powerful new machines. Expand your lab, speed up production, and unlock stronger creations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/f22d235b4ea4e1c1ff16de41c3f5d352.poster.avif?t=1758039285\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/f22d235b4ea4e1c1ff16de41c3f5d352.webm?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/f22d235b4ea4e1c1ff16de41c3f5d352.mp4?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine three Fulus into one evolved form with the merge machine. Unlock stronger abilities, higher essence yield, and powerful new battle options.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.poster.avif?t=1758039285\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.webm?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.mp4?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your playful Fulus out of trouble, look after them when they get mischievous, and make sure your lab stays a place where creatures feel happy and healthy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.poster.avif?t=1758039285\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.webm?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.mp4?t=1758039285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Monster Lab Simulator delivers the thrill of synthesis and battle, the joy of collection, and the magic of uncovering the unknown all inside your very own monster lab.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synthesize essences to hatch unique monsters from eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover recipes through different combinations and unlock surprise Fulus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed, train, and empower your monsters with orbs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter turn-based battles in the battle station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in tournaments for rewards or fight in free matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orb your creatures to preserve them and expand your permanent collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your lab, improve machines, and maintain hygiene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden combinations to discover rare and legendary monsters.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994610?t=1758039285","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994610?t=1758039285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/770cc62f535d8aad2314f85507421385b5d50197/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758039285","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/770cc62f535d8aad2314f85507421385b5d50197/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758039285","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Lab Simulator</strong> is a creature collector that lets you create, raise, train, and battle your own monsters. Every ex